1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,560
Six a.m. flight from Heathrow. Four a.m. taxi?

2
00:00:03,610 --> 00:00:06,660
Drive yourself instead, with Meet and Greet.

3
00:00:06,710 --> 00:00:09,610
Hand your keys to the driver at the terminal.

4
00:00:09,660 --> 00:00:12,410
Then walk straight in. No shuttle wait.

5
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:15,600
When you land back, your car is waiting for you.

6
00:00:15,650 --> 00:00:20,960
Quick challenge. Which Heathrow terminal opened in 2008? Comment below.

7
00:00:21,010 --> 00:00:23,980
So, no four a.m. taxi this Christmas.
